@base <https://www.purl.org/termmetadata/shape> .
@prefix termmeta: <https://www.purl.org/termmetadata/shape> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>. 
@prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix schema: <https://www.schema.org/> .
@prefix gndo: <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/gnd#> .
@prefix physh: <https://physh.org/rdf/2018/01/01/core#> .
@prefix obo: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix oio: <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#> .
@prefix emmo: <http://emmo.info/emmo#> .
@prefix vann: <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .

# TODOS
## make nicer termgraph with more meaningful values
